LITTLE FALLS, N.J. - (BUSINESS WIRE) - Dec. 29, 2005 - mPhase Technologies (OTCBB: XDSL) CEO Ron Durando, today said the company is poised to deliver a substantial breakthrough in battery technology utilizing superhydrophopic nano-patterned structures. \
