\
Now even smaller, the patented ultrasonic linear motor offers long travel and sub-micrometer precision for mobile products including phone cameras and medical devices \
\
The tiny SQL Series SQUIGGLE motor, announced today by New Scale Technologies, Inc., offers precise linear motion at low power for today's smaller portable OEM electronic products. Applications include medical devices, wireless security cameras, and mobile phone camera auto focus/optical zoom assemblies. \
\
At 2.4mm x 2.4 mm, the new SQL series motor is half the size of the company's earlier motors for OEMs. It features a new metal/ceramic composite construction for greater robustness and lower cost. \
\
The patented ultrasonic motor design has much lower power consumption than miniature electromagnetic motors. It holds its position when the power is turned off, further conserving battery life. \
\
Standard SQL evaluation models are available now in 2.4 mm and 3.4 mm size, with customizable shaft length and travel range. \
\
\
\
