pSivida owns the intellectual property pertaining to BioSilicon(TM) for use in or on humans and animals. The IP portfolio consists of 29 patent families, 36 granted patents and over 80 patent applications. The core patent, which recognises BioSilicon(TM) as a biomaterial was granted in the UK in 2000 and in the US in 2001. \
