outerwear fabrics has generated a large proportion of the company's\
sales. In its 50-year history, W L Gore has taken advantage of its\
first-mover advantages in Gore-Tex and built a reputation for good \
quality and innovative products. As competition intensifies, W L Gore\
will need to play to these strengths more than ever.\
