            versus $3 million in the third quarter of 2004.\
\
    --  Gross profit increased nine percent, to $58 million versus\
        $54 million for the third quarter of 2004, benefiting from\
        lower costs resulting from operating efficiencies.\
\
    --  Selling, general and administrative and research and\
        development (SG&A and R&D) expenses together totaled $26\
        million while interest expense was $13 million, both in line\
        with the company's third quarter and full year guidance.\
\
