A123Systems Unveils Lithium-Ion Battery Technology That Delivers Unprecedented Levels of Power, Safety and Life; Nanotech-Enabled Batteries Deliver up to 10X Longer Cycle Life, 5X Power Gains and 5-Minute Charge Time \
857 words\
2 November 2005\
11:00 GMT\
