Chicago-based ipIQ focuses on advancing patent-based intellectual property as a measurable financial asset. Using proprietary tools, ipIQ integrates intellectual property into corporate decision-making, including evaluating mergers and acquisition and identifying areas for capital investment. For additional information on the Patent Scorecard and ipIQ, go to www.ipIQ.com . \
