SC05, sponsored by ACM and IEEE Computer Society, is the premier international conference on high performance computing, networking and storage, and will showcase how high performance computing, networking, storage and analytics lead to advances in research, education and commerce. The conference includes technical and education programs, workshops, tutorials, an exhibit area, demonstrations and hands-on learning. Visit us at http://sc05.supercomputing.org . \
\
