"Each year the Georgia Life Sciences Summit sets a new attendance record," said Charles Craig, president of the Georgia Biomedical Partnership. "Escalating enthusiasm for the Summit reflects the dramatic growth of the state's bioscience industry and its impact far beyond Georgia. The 2005 Summit will be the best ever, showcasing advanced science and R&D at Georgia's publicly traded and privately held companies and the state's world-class universities." \
\
