\
In addition to the keynoters, discussion panels will feature speakers from local and regional companies and universities, along with nationally and internationally recognized leaders in science, business, finance, public policy and government. Topics will include advances in personalized medicine, challenges in regulation and reimbursement of modern medicines, changes in investment trends, strategies for biodefense, and efforts to commercialize university research discoveries. \
