\
"Together with our recently acquired PROQUIN(R) XR and PROSED(R) product lines, ESTRASORB strengthens our pre-eminence in the area of women's healthcare and offers substantial opportunities to realize benefits associated with product synergies," noted Mr. Spitznagel. He concluded saying, "Esprit is also in advanced discussions to acquire additional products in this specialty." \
