"The next step is to move quickly from prototype to commercial product, and in doing so, we wanted to work closely with a company that has a proven track record in building quality electronic devices in both small and large volumes. IMS Corporation, and its sister companies under the AIM Corp Group clearly fall into this category", stated Dr Peter Moran, Singular ID's Chief Technology Officer. \
