BioSante Announces First Transdermal Estradiol Gel with 3 Doses That Significantly Decrease Hot Flashes in Menopausal Women; BioSante's Bio-E-Gel (TM) Shows 88% Decrease in Hot Flashes and the Lowest Effective Dose is Established, According to Data at NAMS \
