"Biofriendly's Green Plus additive is a very economical, easy to implement solution in compliance with the Texas LED regulations," said Pam Royer, manager fuels planning and regulatory compliance. "As an approved alternative diesel fuel formulation, Green Plus has achieved equivalency to California diesel emissions and that is a major benefit to the market and the entire State of Texas. We'll be ready to deliver TxLED fuel to our customers by Oct. 1," she added. \
