\
"This is the 31st patented technology for which we have acquired rights since the beginning of the year," commented Paul Ryan, Chairman and CEO of Acacia. "Our diversification has already resulted in our receiving revenues from many different portfolios and we expect our revenue opportunities to continue to increase as we initiate licensing and enforcement campaigns for the newly acquired technologies," concluded Mr. Ryan. \
