\
H.B. Fuller Company is a 118-year-old worldwide manufacturer of adhesives, sealants, coatings, paints and other specialty chemicals with corporate headquarters in St. Paul, Minn. Fiscal 2004 net revenue was $1.410 billion. Common stock is traded on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol FUL. For more information about the company, visit the Web site at: http://www.hbfuller.com . \
