Recently, TEN has hosted delegates from China's Ministry of Education, DR-CAFTA countries, Vietnam's Ministry of Science and Technology, the Barcelona Chamber of Commerce, and a U.S. Department of Commerce Inter-American E-Business delegation from Peru. TEN currently has a working partnership with the Greater San Jose Hispanic Chamber of Commerce (GSJHCC) for global business development for entrepreneurs. In February 2005, the Mexico-Silicon Valley Technology Business Accelerator (TECHBA) was officially opened at TEN's Sobrato Center for Innovation through an alliance with the United States-Mexico Foundation for Science (FUMEC) and the Mexico's Ministry of Economy. \
\
