\
Dr. Kiss is one of the chief inventors of the digital watch, and has over 30 patents to his credit, including fundamental nanotechnology patents which were acquired by Nanergy when it purchased the nanotechnology assets of RES. Mr. Moshe Gluzman will remain with the company as Senior Vice President for Government Affairs and Corporate Secretary. \
