"In the past year alone, we more than doubled the number of mills, brands and products utilizing Nano-Tex treatments," said Renee Hultin, president of the Americas at Nano-Tex. "With an expanded team, we will continue to drive the adoption of our technology into new categories of the apparel and home furnishings markets." \
