\
About Nano-Tex \
\
Nano-Tex is headquartered in Emeryville, Calif., with operations in Greensboro, NC; Belgium; China; England; India; Italy; South Korea; and Turkey. Nano-Tex develops and markets a family of nanotechnology-based textile treatments that dramatically improves the performance of everyday fabrics. To date, more than 80 textile mills worldwide are utilizing Nano-Tex treatments in products sold by more than 100 leading apparel and interior furnishings brands, including Gap, Old Navy, Lee, Nike, Champion, Levi and Simmons. Products with Nano-Tex enhancements are sold throughout North America, Asia and Europe. www.nano-tex.com \
