\
"Dr. Helmus possesses three decades of experience in medical device research and business development. His expertise in assessing the cost-effectiveness of next generation implants, devices and tissue engineered constructs will help guide Advance Nanotech's BioPharma Group," said Gittins. "We look forward to working with Dr. Helmus as we expand and grow the Advance Nanotech portfolio." \
