Biophan Technologies, Inc. (OTCBB: BIPH), a developer of next-generation biomedical technology, has announced a far-reaching new strategic business initiative to enter the field of cardiovascular diagnostic and therapeutic devices, one of the fastest-growing and largest segments of the biomedical industry. Biophan CEO Michael Weiner announced the new initiative at today's annual shareholder meeting at The Lodge at Woodcliff in Fairport, NY. \
