\
Biophan provides a range of proprietary technologies that make medical devices safe and/or image compatible within Magnetic Resonance Imaging (MRI) systems. The Company is a leader in the development of nanotechnology and other solutions that eliminate safety concerns and image artifact problems that result when certain medical devices are placed within an MRI environment. Biophan's proprietary technologies are designed to enable patients with medical implants such as pacemakers, ICD's and neurostimulators to safely and effectively undergo MRI scanning, and for devices such as stents and vena cava filters to be effectively imaged under MRI. The Company's advanced solutions are also enabling the development of solutions for MRI-guided interventional procedures that were never before possible. \
