Biophan is also marketing a unique MRI-compatible ceramic motor, called the Squiggle(TM) that can be used for a number of advanced applications, such as drug pumps. The Squiggle(TM) motor boasts a simplified design and ultra-high precision. Biophan's Nanolution division develops nanotechnologies to enable improved drug delivery and drug elution from medical devices. And Biophan is working with NASA on a new battery for implanted devices that are powered by body heat instead of chemicals. \
