Team Nanotec GmbH was founded in 1997 as an IBM Germany spin-off. The Company combines unique research and manufacturing skills with extensive experience in micro- and nanofabrication technology. The company pioneered stencil mask technology and the batch fabrication of silicon AFM probe tips and tip characterizers. Many leading semiconductor manufacturers use the Company's high quality AFM probe tips. Team Nanotec also provides development and manufacturing of 3-D silicon MEMS components for electron beam systems, microfluidic-and microoptical devices. Rapid prototyping and versatility is our key strength. Team Nanotec's headquarters and manufacturing facility is located in the HSG-IMIT, Villingen-Schwenningen, Germany. Further information on Team Nanotec can be found at http://www.team-nanotec.de . \
