\
SciTegic, a wholly owned subsidiary of Accelrys, Inc. (NASDAQ:ACCL), develops and markets informatics software to the pharmaceutical and biotechnology industries. SciTegic has pioneered a technology approach called "Data Pipelining" to process drug discovery data with unprecedented flexibility. This methodology has established its utility by accelerating informatics research for thousands of users at hundreds of customer sites worldwide. Further information about SciTegic is available at: www.scitegic.com . \
