US Army Taps Konarka for $1.6 Million Renewable Energy Program; Company's Light-Activated Power Plastic Will Be Incorporated into Critical Applications for Soldier Support Systems \
712 words\
4 May 2005\
12:00 GMT\
Business Wire\
English\
