\
CEO Outlines Strategy to Continue Growth of Intellectual Property Portfolio and Build Additional Relationships with Device Manufacturers \
\
Biophan Technologies, Inc. (OTCBB: BIPH), a developer of next-generation biomedical technology, has announced the availability of an online interview given by CEO Michael Weiner to AudioStocks.com, a financial information portal targeted at industry professionals and interested investors. \
\
During the in-depth interview, Mr. Weiner discussed Biophan's strategy to leverage its technology and product solutions to create advanced products in a number of multi-billion-dollar biomedical markets. Biophan product initiatives he described include nanotechnology, drug-delivery and drug-elution, and Magnetic Resonance Imaging (MRI) safety and compatibility for important medical devices such as pacemakers. \
