\
"Our goal is to continue to grow and to innovate, and to find unmet needs of the biomedical device industry, (and) now the pharmaceutical industry, such as drug delivery, and innovate with very aggressive early stage inventions, followed up by proof-of-principal prototyping, and good sales and marketing, and then great customer support," Mr. Weiner said in the interview. "We have a number of big companies that we haven't announced yet that we are working with and a number of government agencies that we're working with. The implication of these trends is that we are going to be more solidly involved with more and more companies, providing more and more important and competitive solutions." \
