SANTA MONICA, Calif. - (BUSINESS WIRE) - March 1, 2005 - Leading PR agencies Pacific Media Partners (PMP) and DatelineMedia (DM), today announced a strategic alliance designed to further broaden the media reach in the US for their clients. The alliance formalizes a long standing relationship between the two firms who have collaborated on a number of clients, including the Game Developers' Association of Australia (GDAA) and a number of high-level business and investor projects. \
\
Pacific Media Partners and DatelineMedia currently offer media and editorial strategy to a broad range of clients from consumer electronics and video games, to biotech, pharmaceuticals, nutraceuticals, and nanotech. They also support firms in their investor relations activities and have deep connections in the business and investor media community. \
\
"We are excited about a closer relationship between our two firms," said Richard Sherman, president and co-founder, Pacific Media Partners. "DatelineMedia, with its business, tech, and biotech media connections increases opportunities for our clients to receive coverage in these areas." \
\
"Clients will benefit from the extended reach brought about through the alliance, with PMP based in Los Angeles and DM having offices in San Francisco, New York and Sydney," said DatelineMedia CEO Susan Fitzpatrick. "We are particularly excited about the nutraceuticals expertise that PMP brings to the alliance as this industry is a hot and growing sector in Australia with many firms needing the right PR and marketing support on the ground in the US." \
\
"PMP also provides expert media buying, web development, and graphic design, which makes the Agency alliance a full service offering," said James Little, VP and co-founder, Pacific Media Partners. "We look forward to assisting in these areas." \
\
About Pacific Media Partners \
\
Santa Monica, CA-based Pacific Media Partners (PMP) is a full-service marketing firm that specializes in the video game, consumer electronics, nutraceuticals, and high-tech industries. Offering revenue-generating strategies for its clients, PMP's mission is to provide seamlessly integrated marketing strategies that get measurable results. For more information, visit www.pacificmediapartners.com . \
\
About DatelineMedia \
\
DatelineMedia Communications (USA) LLC is a U.S. based national communications and media strategy firm with direct connections into the biotech, life sciences and investment media. Founded in 2002 by U.S. and Australian journalists, the Agency has grown from its head office in San Francisco to include offices in New York and Sydney, with an affiliate in Washington, D.C. For more information, visit www.datelinemedia.com \
