\
CustomArrays(TM) are semiconductor-based arrays (approx. 1 cm2) integrated onto a standard 1" x 3" slide format. CombiMatrix synthesizes oligonucleotides in situ to build CustomArrays. This revolutionary technology allows CombiMatrix to deliver CustomArrays in days. Sensitivity and performance metrics are available on the company's main web site and at www.customarray.com . \
