\
By reducing the build-up of electrical charges on fabric, this new technology also helps eliminate static shocks. Resists Static can be applied to fleece, activewear, uniforms, suit linings and slacks, in addition to other garments. Fleece apparel, a $3 billion market, is one of the fastest-growing retail apparel categories. (Source: Wearables Business) \
