"We're eliminating some of the most frustrating experiences consumers face in everyday apparel, from business attire to casual kids wear," said Renee Hultin, president of the Americas for Nano-Tex. "For example, consumers love fleece but hate the static cling and shocks that come with it. Our new treatments enhance the appearance, comfort, versatility -- and ultimately the length of use -- of clothing consumers use most often in everyday life." \
