UEL has already raised $9.125 million in charitable contributions from Minnesota corporations and organizations including Xcel Energy, 3M, Allina, the University of Minnesota, the University of Minnesota Foundation, Boston Scientific, Guidant, Ecolab, City of St. Paul, Medtronic, Surmodics, and Dorsey & Whitney. \
